herdr.ico is a Windows ICO conversion of the official Herdr artwork:
https://github.com/penso/herdr-gpui/blob/79ca2ce97b45089e792e7bc5e14a0554c74077b9/assets/icons/herdr-ui-icon-clean.png

The PNG was resized to 16, 24, 32, 48, 64, 128, and 256 pixels using macOS
sips and packaged as PNG images in an ICO container. The artwork is unchanged.

The application icon uses a ram path adapted from Herdr's logo:
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr/blob/HEAD/assets/logo.svg
The upstream artwork is licensed under Apache-2.0. This adaptation places the
ram and terminal prompt on a simple ivory tile, with modified scaling,
placement, and flat graphite coloring.

